  ('Cairo', 'Egypt', 30.0444, 31.2357, 1920, '/rounds/Cairo_1920.png', 'Cairo in 1920 is represented as an early modern Nile capital, with arid light, Islamic urban details, and interwar street life.', ARRAY['Dry North African light and flat urban terrain near a major river valley', 'Islamic architectural details such as domes, minarets, mashrabiya screens, or arched arcades', 'Dense Middle Eastern street life with markets, carts, and low-rise masonry buildings']::text[], ARRAY['Early automobiles or horse-drawn transport can coexist with traditional street activity', 'Interwar clothing such as fezzes, galabiyas, suits, and long dresses', 'No modern high-rises, satellite dishes, contemporary road markings, or postwar vehicles']::text[], 'Do not show the name of the location anywhere in the image. Do not include visible text, captions, labels, map names, titles, or signage that explicitly reveals the city, country, or exact place. Avoid readable signage unless it is generic and non-revealing. The image must contain clues, but must not directly state the answer.', 'approved', 'manual', 3, true),
  ('Shanghai', 'China', 31.2304, 121.4737, 1930, '/rounds/Shangai_1930.png', 'Shanghai in 1930 is represented as a treaty-port metropolis with river commerce, Art Deco density, and Chinese street life.', ARRAY['Riverfront commerce or Bund-like waterfront massing', 'Chinese street-market details mixed with international commercial architecture', 'Flat delta-city setting with trams, rickshaws, bicycles, or busy port streets']::text[], ARRAY['Interwar Art Deco, 1920s-1930s suits, and qipao silhouettes', 'Rickshaws, trams, bicycles, and early cars fit the period', 'Avoid communist-era iconography, post-1980 skyscrapers, and contemporary traffic infrastructure']::text[], 'Do not show the name of the location anywhere in the image. Do not include visible text, captions, labels, map names, titles, or signage that explicitly reveals the city, country, or exact place. Avoid readable signage unless it is generic and non-revealing. The image must contain clues, but must not directly state the answer.', 'approved', 'manual', 3, true),
  ('Buenos Aires', 'Argentina', -34.6037, -58.3816, 1910, '/rounds/BuenosAires_1910.png', 'Buenos Aires in 1910 is represented as a prosperous South American capital around the centennial era, with European-influenced avenues and period transport.', ARRAY['Broad avenues and ornate European-influenced civic architecture', 'Flat port-city layout with plazas, tram tracks, or formal boulevards', 'Southern Cone urban vegetation and street scale rather than tropical or Andean terrain']::text[], ARRAY['Edwardian-era dress, horse trams, electric trams, and early automobiles', 'Centennial-era civic grandeur before World War I', 'Avoid postwar buses, modern glass towers, and contemporary signage']::text[], 'Do not show the name of the location anywhere in the image. Do not include visible text, captions, labels, map names, titles, or signage that explicitly reveals the city, country, or exact place. Avoid readable signage unless it is generic and non-revealing. The image must contain clues, but must not directly state the answer.', 'approved', 'manual', 2, true),
  ('Berlin', 'Germany', 52.5200, 13.4050, 1989, '/rounds/Berlino_1989.png', 'Berlin in 1989 is represented as a divided late-Cold-War European capital with concrete barriers, central streets, crowds, and late-1980s material culture.', ARRAY['Central European stone architecture and broad flat avenues', 'Concrete wall sections, border infrastructure, or divided-city visual language', 'Temperate northern European urban density rather than desert or tropical clues']::text[], ARRAY['Late-1980s clothing, compact cars, cameras, and graffiti styles', 'Cold War border details hint at the final year of division', 'Avoid post-reunification street furniture, smartphones, LED displays, and contemporary construction']::text[], 'Do not show the name of the location anywhere in the image. Do not include visible text, captions, labels, map names, titles, or signage that explicitly reveals the city, country, or exact place. Avoid readable signage unless it is generic and non-revealing. The image must contain clues, but must not directly state the answer.', 'approved', 'manual', 2, true),
