  ('Kyoto', 'Japan', 35.0116, 135.7681, 1895, '/rounds/Kyoto_1895.png', 'Kyoto in 1895 is represented as a former imperial Japanese city in the Meiji period, with temples, wooden streets, and transitional dress.', ARRAY['Wooden machiya townhouses, temple roofs, gardens, or narrow lanes', 'Mountain-rimmed basin atmosphere and traditional Japanese urban fabric', 'Shrines, tiled roofs, stone lanterns, or small bridges']::text[], ARRAY['Meiji-era mix of kimono, early Western dress, rickshaws, and pre-automobile streets', 'Late 19th-century visual cues rather than Edo or postwar Japan', 'Avoid neon, bullet trains, modern overhead utilities, and postwar commercial signage']::text[], 'Do not show the name of the location anywhere in the image. Do not include visible text, captions, labels, map names, titles, or signage that explicitly reveals the city, country, or exact place. Avoid readable signage unless it is generic and non-revealing. The image must contain clues, but must not directly state the answer.', 'approved', 'manual', 3, true),
  ('Singapore', 'Singapore', 1.3521, 103.8198, 1959, '/rounds/Singapore_1959.png', 'Singapore in 1959 is represented as a tropical port city at the start of self-government, with shophouses, harbor activity, and multicultural street life.', ARRAY['Tropical humidity, colonial-era shophouses, port commerce, and dense markets', 'Malay, Chinese, Indian, and British-influenced urban details', 'Flat island-city setting with waterfront or commercial street clues']::text[], ARRAY['1950s buses, bicycles, clothing, and shopfront design', 'Self-government period before full independence', 'Avoid Marina Bay skyline, container terminals, MRT infrastructure, and contemporary towers']::text[], 'Do not show the name of the location anywhere in the image. Do not include visible text, captions, labels, map names, titles, or signage that explicitly reveals the city, country, or exact place. Avoid readable signage unless it is generic and non-revealing. The image must contain clues, but must not directly state the answer.', 'approved', 'manual', 3, true),
  ('Baghdad', 'Iraq', 33.3152, 44.3661, 1932, '/rounds/Baghdad_1932.png', 'Baghdad in 1932 is represented as a Mesopotamian river city at the start of the Kingdom of Iraq era, with arid architecture and interwar transport.', ARRAY['Arid river-city environment with palm trees, bazaars, and courtyard architecture', 'Tigris-side clues such as bridges, boats, or low riverbank development', 'Middle Eastern street life and Islamic architectural details']::text[], ARRAY['Interwar clothing and early cars fit the kingdom-era setting', 'Pre-World War II atmosphere without Ottoman-era dominance', 'Avoid Baathist monuments, modern highways, and contemporary concrete skyline']::text[], 'Do not show the name of the location anywhere in the image. Do not include visible text, captions, labels, map names, titles, or signage that explicitly reveals the city, country, or exact place. Avoid readable signage unless it is generic and non-revealing. The image must contain clues, but must not directly state the answer.', 'approved', 'manual', 4, true),
  ('New Orleans', 'United States', 29.9511, -90.0715, 1925, '/rounds/NewOrleans_1925.png', 'New Orleans in 1925 is represented as a Gulf Coast jazz-era port city with balconies, humid streets, streetcars, and period nightlife cues.', ARRAY['Cast-iron balconies, French or Spanish colonial streetscapes, and humid subtropical vegetation', 'Streetcar tracks, river-port atmosphere, and low-rise historic neighborhoods', 'Gulf Coast architecture distinct from northern United States cities']::text[], ARRAY['Jazz Age clothing, 1920s automobiles, streetcars, and analog storefronts', 'Prohibition-era mood without explicit written labels', 'Avoid postwar neon strips, modern tourist branding, and contemporary vehicles']::text[], 'Do not show the name of the location anywhere in the image. Do not include visible text, captions, labels, map names, titles, or signage that explicitly reveals the city, country, or exact place. Avoid readable signage unless it is generic and non-revealing. The image must contain clues, but must not directly state the answer.', 'approved', 'manual', 2, true),
